[node name="ApartmentLivingWindow" type="Node3D"]
metadata/_doc = "Window 5 x 2.45 m, 3 bay(s), opening 0..2.45 m above the floor. Origin on the room floor at the opening's center on the wall's center line; -Z is outside. GENERATED by tools/props/window.py from tools/props/windows/ (apartment_living); edit the spec, not this file. Panel on the west side: top button runs the shades (press again to stop, again to reverse), bottom button steps the smart glass tint (clear, half, dark). HUD readout (time, temperature, weather) in the lower east corner of bay 2."

